      "verdict": "qualified-only-for-original-no-MIR-guards",
      "basis": "F200 D3 exact no-MIR CreateOnly result and F210 SteamFE4 actual two-mod absence result retain their original engines/fixtures. F210 dirty-source label and missing original profile bytes remain explicit. Byte-identical first-line guards precede changed code. No standalone8DC absence execution is asserted."
    },
    {
      "subject": "boundary budgets",
      "verdict": "qualified-host-admission-contract-only",
      "basis": "Existing 100 host observations establish the combined finite admission contract. A populated 64-row family may exceed the shared512-entry budget; no native speed or all-limits-at-once promise follows."
    },
    {
      "subject": "foreign interface/previous consumers",
      "verdict": "bounded-host-and-available-archive-review",
      "basis": "Foreign-interface collision refusal is host-only. Thirty-one-archive audit has zero named old-interface/SDK/MEP matches; computed/external names remain unknown. No externally consumed old contract is retired."
